# Shell artefacts: agent runs occasionally leave files whose names are
# fragments of code ("(r.Actual", "{const", "$t"). No real source file in this
# repo has a character outside [A-Za-z0-9._/-], so ignore anything that does.
# scripts/check_tree_hygiene.mjs is the enforcing guard (pre-commit + CI).
*[(){}$`'"!?,+|<>=*]*

